  "_doc": [
    "Hand-set values that the wiki does not provide. Everything here is src:'design' unless it sits under a 'wiki' key.",
    "spells.<id>.speed/lifetime: projectile flight speed (m/s) and lifetime (s); summons: move speed and lifetime (0 = until killed); Boost/Passive: 0/0.",
    "spells.<id>.wiki: numeric fields stated only in wiki page prose (not infobox) -> keeps src:'wiki'.",
    "spells.<id>.design: invented per-level field overrides -> src:'design'.",
    "spells.<id>.modsDesign: per-level SpellMods overrides for values the wiki leaves as TBD -> src:'design'.",
    "setSpells: set-starting spells (upgrade 'none', never in shops).",
    "dpsTickDefault: tick rate for (DPS) spells missing from the wiki Tick rate table.",
    "wandSlotBands: [maxMp, slots] ascending; first band with mp <= maxMp wins. wandSlots overrides per id.",
    "wandTierBands: [maxMp, tier] ascending; mp above the last band -> tier 5.",
    "wands.<id>: partial WandDef overrides for wiki gaps (zeroed stats, truncated passives).",
    "curses.<id>: params replacing the wiki's int1/float1/int2 placeholders, in placeholder order.",
    "potions.<id>: duration category; seconds are parsed from the wiki effect text for 'timed'."
  ],
